# Runner-vendored TesseraBX add-ons.
#
# The runner clones each repo below into the upstream tree's
# modules/<slug>/ BEFORE the docker build, and the upstream Dockerfile
# COPYs them into the image. This path is REQUIRED for private add-on
# repos (the docker build has no git credentials), and is also handy for
# public repos because it copies the add-on source directly (a plain git
# clone, with no dependency resolution). Public add-ons that box install
# can resolve may instead be listed in overlay/box.addons.json.
#
# One add-on per line, whitespace-separated:
#
#   <git-url>                                          <ref>   <slug>
#
#   <git-url>  required. HTTPS for public repos; SSH (or HTTPS plus a
#              token, see GH_PAT in the README) for private repos.
#   <ref>      optional, default main. A branch, tag, or commit SHA.
#   <slug>     optional, default the repo name. Becomes modules/<slug>/.
#
# Lines starting with # and blank lines are ignored.
#
# EXAMPLE: tesserabx-pm is a PUBLIC repo, cloned anonymously over HTTPS.
# Pin <ref> to a tag for reproducible production deploys.
https://github.com/oistechnologies/tesserabx-pm.git   main   tesserabx-pm
